# Frontend configuration. Copy to `.env.local` to use; Vite reads it at build time.
# Values are baked into the JavaScript bundle and visible to anyone, so never put secrets here.

# The API's public URL, with no trailing slash and no /api.
# Leave unset for local development: the Vite dev server forwards /api to http://localhost:8000.
# In production (e.g. on Render) set it on the static site, then rebuild:
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-api.onrender.com
